<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Benamanga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Vatesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa lya pili lya Paulo kwa Vatesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Vatesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Vat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa lya uvili lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Vatesalonike</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa lya uvili kwa Vatesalonike isimbililwe na Mnjagila Paulo mu sula lya 1.1. Paulo asimbile baluwa iyi chipindi chidodo kuhuma peasimbilye yila baluwa lya kwanja kwa Vatesalonike ikali mumyaka gya amsini na yimwi peababilwe Yesu Kilisito. Paulo akali Kolinito chipindi peisimba baluwa iyi kwa lipinga lya vanu va Nguluvi vevamdikiye Kilisito lya ku Tesalonike, Lipinga lya vanu va Nguluvi vevamdikiye Kilisito likavangile mulugendo lwake lwa uvili mu kasi lyake lya kudalika. Magito mu sula lya 17.1-10. Gilonga mukiganulo kya Magito kuva Lipinga lya vanu vevamdikiye Yesu Kilisito vakali Vayawudi vadodo na Vagiliki volofu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lipinga lya vanu vevamdikiye Yesu Kilisito lya Tesalonike likali na wogofi fipindi fya mwiso na kuwuya kwa Kilisito, kwakuva Paulo akasimbile fyolofu fyefimuhumulila mwene mubaluwa chake chonda kwa Vatesalonike. Nusu lya kiganulo kya Vatesalonike va uvili kihumulila chipindi cha mwiso. Kangi Paulo akalakalile ugata. Kila munu agite kasi neke awese kupatila kyakuliya kyake musula lya 3.6-10</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegagehe</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo ikwanja kusimba baluwa kwa kwitambucha mwene na vala vevakali pamwi na mwene, Vatesalonike va uvili, mu sula lya 1.1-2.</para>
  <para style="io">Baho, Paulo akumuhongecha Nguluvi kwa vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito va ukoya ku Tesalonike na kuvasukila kwa Nguluvi, Vatesalonike va uvili, mu sula lya 1.3-12.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula lya uvili, Paulo ihumulila chipindi cha mwiso.</para>
  <para style="io">Baho Paulo akuvayakilila vagata na ving'wang'wa kugita kasi, Vatesalonike va uvili, mu sula lya 3.1-15.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo isindila kwa kuvahungila kangi vanu vevamdikiye Yesu Kilisito, Vatesalonike va uvili, mu sula 3.16-18.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Nene Paulo, pamwi na Silivanusi na Timotewo, tukuvasimbiliya baluwa iyi vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito va ku Tesalonike, mwevali vanu vake Daada vetu Nguluvi na Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Tukuvang'ang'ila usangi na lutengamaso kuhuma kwa Nguluvi Daada vetu na kwa Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhigo chipindi cha kwacha Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Vakolo vetu, tung'ang'wa kumuhongecha Nguluvi figono fyonda kwajili lyenu. Nefwe twing'ang'wa kugita ndena kwakuva udikilo lyenu wikongeleka hilo na kukelana kwa nyenye kwikongeleka hilo. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Kwakuva nefwe tukwidumbila nyenye mu mapinga gya vanu gekumdikila Kilisito kwakuva lya uhuvililo va nyenye na kudikila kuchumbila magudo na utumama chechimupatila.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Aga gonda gichelisa kuva lihigo lya Nguluvi ndi lya undakyene, fyonda fyemwigita neke muwonike mwing'ang'wa kwingila mu Ung'achale va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, kwajili lyake nyenye mugudika. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Nguluvi daigita lukani lwa undakyene, dakuvawuyisila magudo vala vevakuvagudisa nyenye, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />na kuvagita nyenye yemugudika mutulule pamwi na nefwe. Daigita luchowo hulo chipindi Mtwa Yesu peikwacha kuhuma kuluhano kwa Nguluvi pamwi na vandumindumi vake vevali na ludali, <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />na lwenge lwa lyoto na kuvatova vala vanu vevakumlema Nguluvi na vala sevaidikila Njowo Nofu lya Mtwa vetu Yesu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Davitovwa kwa kuhanangwa mbepali na kunengwa patali na Mtwa na ukomi vake mkomi, <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />chipindi dapeikwcha Kilisito, kigono kya kuwanuka ukomi kwa vanu vake na uginyange kuhuma kwa vanu vonda wevidikila. Na nyenye damuvecha mugati lya vene, kwakuva mukaudikila wula unanzi vetukavalongiye.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Nde mana tukuvalumbila kwa Nguluvi figono fyonda. Tukumlumba Nguluvi vetu avagite nyenye mwemwing'ang'wa kwikala ngita pevakemeliye. Tukumlumba, kwa umwimike vake, avawesese kusindicha kwa ludali lwake gyala gyonda ganofu gemkela kugita na kusindicha kasi chenu chonda cha udikilo. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Twilumba ndena neke litawa lya Mtwa vetu Yesu liwanuke ukomi kuhuma kwa nyenye na nyenye damwipata ukomi kuhuma kwa mwene kwa usangi va Nguluvi vetu na Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Yula munu yeidenya malagilicho ga Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Nondee, ichi ndi njowo cha kwacha kwa Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito na petukung'aswa pamwi na kwikala na mwene, tukuvasuka hilo, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />mubihile kuhogoswa kisatu kwa kila kyemkidikiye na mubihile kuva na uwogofi kwakuva lya njowo cha vanu vevilonga kuva kigono kya Mtwa kigehe pepi kufika. Mbihile kuvadikila vanu avo kwa kulonga kuva vapatile njowo icho kwa ng'asi lya kulota na madaliko awu baluwa yeyihochilwe ihumile kwa nefwe. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Munu yeyonda abihile kuvachanga kwa kinu kyokyonda kila. Kwakuva kigono iko sedakikwacha mbaka wula uwofu uhumile tandi na yula munu yeidenya malagilicho ga Nguluvi awoneke na mwiso vake ndi kuhanangwa tipu. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Mwene akwidumba kwa finu fyonda fyevilola vanu kuva ndi valungu vangi awu kyevakuchigundamila ata iwesa kwingila mu Kaye lya Nguluvi kuno akwinjuma kuva mwene ndi Nguluvi.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Wuli, semuwika kuva ndikavalongie aga gyonda chipindi pendigehe pamwi na nyenye? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Ila kigehe kinu kyekimkanila yula munu yeidenya malagilicho ga Nguluvi na nyenye mukichela kinu ikyo. Suwe, uyo munu yeidenya malagilicho ga Nguluvi dawoneka chipindi pechifika. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Ludali chechifihiye cha yula munu yeidenya malagilicho ga Nguluvi chigita kasi ata nondee, ila yula yeakumkanila iendelela kumkanila mbaka yula yeakumkanicha ahechwe, <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />ila munu uyo yeidenya malagilicho ga Nguluvi dahumila, ila Mtwa Yesu peikwacha damdocha kwa kumpumulila muhe vake na kumuhananga kwa welu daikwacha navo. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Uyu munu yeidenya malagilicho ga Nguluvi daikwacha na ludali lwa Setani na kugita kila namuna lya umunyitu na filuwiluwi fya udesi, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />na kugita udesi va kila namuna kwa vala vevagehe mulipinga lya kuyaganika. Avo davayaganika kwakuva sevauwanuke na kuukela wula undakyene neke valowolwe. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Kwa ndeni, Nguluvi kavavika panyi lya ludali lya uyaganifu neke vadikiye udesi, <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />ila vonda vevilema kudikila undakyene na vevikedukila sambi, davahigwa nongwa.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhaguliwe neke mulowolwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Ila nondee tung'ang'wa kumlumba Nguluvi mbepali kwakuva lyenu vakolo, nyenye yemukelwa na Mtwa, kwakuva Nguluvi avahagula kuhuma pamwindi neke mulowolwe kwa kuchumbila kuhogofichwa kwa Muhe va Nguluvi na kudikila mu undakyene. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Nguluvi avakemeliye luchowo ulu kwa ng'asi lya Njowo Nofu chetuvadalikile, avakemeliye neke muwanuke pono lya ukomi va Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Nondee, vakolo vetu, mkangamale na kukolela unofu gala mawulanicho getukavawulanichile kwa madaliko gyetu na gyetugavasimbiliye.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Tukumlumba Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito mwene na Daada vetu Nguluvi yeatukeliye kwa usanzi vake akatugaviye unamacha lwa mbepali na luhuvilo lyeligehe na ludali, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />avanamache na kuvagangamicha mu kila lukani lunofu lwemugita na magito manofu.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Mutulumbile kwa Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Nondee, vakolo, mutulumbile kwa Nguluvi neke unanzi va Mtwa ugine kulutala kisatu na kuwanukwa kwa uginyage ngita fila peigehe pagati penu, <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />neke Nguluvi atulowe na vanu vahofu na vanjanganifu, kwakuva se vonda vevidikila unanzi ugu.<verse eid="2TH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Ila Mtwa idikilwa na dakuvakangamalicha na kuvadima unofu na yula munu muhofu. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Na nefwe tukumuhuvila Mtwa kwa njowo chemuchigita na damwiendelela kugita gala gyetuvalongiye.<verse eid="2TH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Mtwa achilongoche numbula chenu mu lukelo va Nguluvi na luhuvililo veuhuma kwa Kilisito.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lakililo lwa munu yeseigita kasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Vakolo vetu, tukuvalagilicha kwa litawa lya Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito, muyinenge na vakolo vonda yevavali vagata na sevagita malagilicho getuvagavile. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Mwavene mwichela kuva mung'ang'wa kugita ngita nefwe. Kwakuva petugehe na nyenye setukali vagata, <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />se tukaliye kyakuliya kwa munu yeyonda bila kumuhomba. Tukagitle kasi kwa kugangamala na kugudika pamunyi na pamiye neke tubihile kuva mchigo kwa munu yeyonda pagati penu. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Tukagitile kasi se kwakuva tulema kutangwa na nyenye, ila tung'ang'a mugite ngita nefwe petugitile. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Petugehe pamwi na nyenye tukali tukuvalongiye, “Munu yeyonda yeilema kugita kasi na abihile kuliya kyakuliya.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Tulonga njowo ichi kwakuva tupulike kuva pagati penu vagehe vagata na sevagita kyokyonda, ila vene ndwangamlomo hela. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Kwa litawa lya Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito tukuvaswitilicha na kuvayakilila vanu avo valeke kundwangamlomo na vagite kasi neke vapatile kyakuliya kyao.<verse eid="2TH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Ila nyenye vakolo vetu, mbihile kufwahila kugita manofu. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Ngita kugehe na munu seidikila malagilicho gyetu gegagehe mubalua iyi, mumlolele hilo munu uyo. Mbihile kugita kasi pamwi na mwene, neke awone nyoni. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Mbihile kumlola munu uyo ngita mchwindama, ila mumlakilile ngita mkolo venu.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhungilo lwa kumalila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Mtwa mwene ndi uvangilo va lutengamaso, avagavile lutengamaso figono fyonda kwa kila namuna yoyonda. Mtwa aveche na nyenye vonda.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Kwa liwoko lyangu yune, ndisimba endee, luhungilo kuhuma kwa Paulo! Iyi ndi saini lyangu kila pendisimba baluwa.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Tukuvang'ang'ila vonda usangi va Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>